PHASE 10 — Student Portal Core

Goal:
Build the adult student portal.

Student pages:
- /student/dashboard
- /student/profile
- /student/lessons
- /student/balance
- /student/homework
- /student/scenarios
- /student/reviews
- /student/materials
- /student/practice-words
- /student/session-notes
- /student/notifications
- /student/referrals

Dashboard should show:
- Upcoming lesson
- Package balance
- Current homework
- Current scenario
- Review/test notifications
- Progress summary
- Streak
- Badges preview
- Practice words due
- Session notes

Security:
- Student can only see own data.

UI:
- Mobile-first.
- Cards.
- Empty states.
- Clear direct action buttons.

Acceptance criteria:
- Student dashboard shows correct data.
- Student cannot access another student.
- Student sees package balance.
- Student sees upcoming lesson.
- Student sees notifications.

Manual test checklist:
- Log in as demo student.
- Open all student pages.
- Confirm data ownership.
- Confirm mobile layout.

Stop condition:
Stop here. Test this phase before continuing.
